#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Rebuild your installed T3 Code Nightly with a stats bar under the composer.

Run it after every T3 Code update. Everything happens on this machine: the
patches in this repo are applied to the exact upstream commit your application was
built from and the web, server and desktop bundles are rebuilt. On Linux and
Windows the result is laid over a copy of your app. On macOS your signed app is
left as it is and the launcher loads the rebuilt bundles into it at startup.
Your installed app and your T3 data are never modified. `server` does the same
for a headless T3 server, `ios` for the iOS app and `fleet` for every machine.
"""
